.th FERR I 8/12/77
.sh NAME
ferr - Fortran error messages
.sh SYNOPSIS
ferr error-number ...
.sh DESCRIPTION
Prints the error message(s) associated with each specified
Fortran error number.

Includes both compile-time and run-time errors.
.sh BUGS
Error message text is copied from Interdata manuals.
Messages are ambiguous,
misleading,
and sometimes dead wrong.
